        {
          "text": "Indlu kaJakobe iyakuba ngumlilo, nendlu kaJosefa ibe yilangabi, indlu ka-Esawu ibe ngamabibi, bawuthungele bayiqede; futhi akuyikusala lutho lwendlu ka-Esawu; ngoba uJehova ukukhulumile.",
          "type": "text",
