        {
          "text": "Abasuka eningizimu bayakudla ifa lentaba yakwa-Esawu; nabasethafeni, amaFilisti, badle ifa lensimu yakwa-Efrayimi nensimu yaseSamariya; uBenjamini uyakudla iGileyadi.",
